AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Help › >Keys<
 1 Recognize     │  Getting started  Guide  Commands >Keys< Exit codes  Links 
 2 Now playing   │ Moving around
 3 Streams       │   Menu on the left, page on the right. Arrows move, Enter goes in, Esc comes back.
 4 History       │   The menu is the sidebar; Help, Streams, History, and Account have a tab bar above their page. A key
 5 Account       │   that does nothing where you press it says so at the bottom.
 6 Settings      │ 
*7 Help          >   ↑/↓            move in the menu, a list, or a form
                 │   → or enter     go in: open the section, the page, the selected item
                 │   ← or esc       come back one level (in typed text ← moves the cursor)
                 │   ←/→            on a tab bar: switch tabs
                 │   ↑              from the top of a page: back to its tab bar
                 │   [ ]            previous or next tab, from anywhere in the section
                 │   → space enter  change a choice ‹ like this ›; ← still goes back
                 │ 
                 │ Everywhere
                 │   1-7            jump to a section
                 │   ctrl+k or :    run any command
                 │   y              copy the command shown at the bottom
                 │   ?              keys for this screen
                 │   F1             help
                 │   q              quit; not while typing, and it asks while a command runs
                 │   ctrl+c         quit, also while typing (it asks while a command runs)
                 │   click, wheel   select or press; scroll
                 │ 
                 │ Mouse
                 │   Click a section, a tab, a row, a field, or a button; click a selected row again to open it. A click
                 │   on a part of the path at the top goes back to it. The wheel scrolls. To select text with the mouse,
                 │   hold Shift (Option in iTerm2). AUDD_NO_MOUSE=1 turns the mouse off.
                 │ 
                 │ Recognize
                 │   ↑/↓            move between fields
                 │   enter          in Input: recognize (the plan comes first); on a button: press it
                 │   → space enter  Source: a file or the microphone
                 │   space, x       tick a box
 ctrl+k commands │   ctrl+o         pick a file or folder (← goes to the parent folder, s picks the folder)
 ? keys  q quit  │   s              stop a batch or a recording
←/→ tabs  ↓ open  esc back  ? keys
ctrl+k runs any audd command